,"连接器扫参","轻量模型"],"updated":"2026-11-02","links":[{"domain":"hf_collection","id":"gatilin/nanovlm-factory-6addc6d2eb1f2ac4e493b2b3","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/collections/gatilin/nanovlm-factory-6addc6d2eb1f2ac4e493b2b3"},{"domain":"hf_collection","id":"gatilin/nanovlm-684ee2c750787233ba47f4d7","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/collections/gatilin/nanovlm-684ee2c750787233ba47f4d7"},{"domain":"hf_model","id":"gatilin/nanoVLM-SmolLM2-dinov2","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/gatilin/nanoVLM-SmolLM2-dinov2"},{"domain":"hf_model","id":"gatilin/nanoVLM-SmolLM2-sglip2","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/gatilin/nanoVLM-SmolLM2-sglip2"},{"domain":"hf_model","id":"gatilin/nanovlm-factory-MoonViT-SO-400M_224_mp2_SmolLM2-360M-Instruct","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/gatilin/nanovlm-factory-MoonViT-SO-400M_224_mp2_SmolLM2-360M-Instruct"},{"domain":"gh_repo","id":"huggingface/nanoVLM","state":"out_of_scope","url":null}],"bytes":506,"lines":6,"sha256":"d754d2423b40f2c3","truncated":false,"url":"https://github.com/isLinXu/model-observatory/blob/main/entities/nanovlm-factory.md","body":"# nanoVLM Factory\n\n视觉编码器 × 连接器的批量扫参产线：在同一批 SmolLM2 底座下替换 dinov2 / siglip / sgclip / MoonViT / convnext 等视觉侧，用来横向比较连接器形态与视觉塔的影响。\n\n- 列出的三个模型只是代表条目，集合本身覆盖全部产出；未登记的成员会出现在「未登记」清单里，而不是被当成缺失。\n- `gh_repo:huggingface/nanoVLM` 是上游框架仓库，属本期范围外，只作对照，不计入核对成功。"},{"slug":"rf100-vl","title":"RF100-VL","kind":"dataset","stage":"shipped","tags":["密集预测","区域级标注","视觉语料"],"updated":"2026-11-02","links":[{"domain":"hf_dataset","id":"gatilin/rf100-vl-datasets","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/gatilin/rf100-vl-datasets"},{"domain":"hf_dataset","id":"gatilin/rf100-vl","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/gatilin/rf100-vl"}],"bytes":283,"lines":5,"sha256":"9b77ab3a30605715","truncated":false,"url":"https://github.com/isLinXu/model-observatory/blob/main/entities/rf100-vl.md","body":"# RF100-VL\n\n面向视觉-语言训练的 RF100 区域级语料整理版，按「完整数据集」与「子集」两种口径分别发布。\n\n- 两个 id 是同一份工作的两种打包，不是两个独立数据集；跨源指标各按各自口径显示，注册表不做合计。"},{"slug":"youtu-ft-v1","title":"Youtu-FT-V1","kind":"project","stage":"shipped","tags":["后训练","MoE","轻量模型"],"updated":"2026-11-02","links":[{"domain":"hf_model","id":"gatilin/Youtu-FT-V1-35B-A3B","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/gatilin/Youtu-FT-V1-35B-A3B"},{"domain":"hf_model","id":"gatilin/Youtu-FT-V1-4B","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/gatilin/Youtu-FT-V1-4B"},{"domain":"hf_model","id":"gatilin/Youtu-FT-V1-9B","state":"resolved","url":"https://huggingface.co/gatilin/Youtu-FT-V1-9B"},{"domain":"hf_space","id":"gatilin/Youtu-VL-demo","state":"unchecked","url":null}],"bytes":568,"lines":7,"sha256":"8e2caf3a50cf4dcb","truncated":false,"url":"https://github.com/isLinXu/model-observatory/blob/main/entities/youtu-ft-v1.md","body":"# Youtu-FT-V1\n\nYoutu 系列的后训练版本，按参数规模分三档发布：35B-A3B（MoE）与 9B、4B 稠密版。\n\n- 与 Youtu-LLM 论文**没有对应关系**，两者是各自独立的工作，注册表不把二者连成一条研究线。\n- `hf_space:` 指向的 demo Space 仍在运行，但本站没有 Space 来源可核对，页面显示「未核对」而不是「已失效」。\n- 上游 Youtu-VL 权重属第三方仓库，本期范围外；若 demo 依赖的是私有仓库，则不进注册表——本仓库与其发布出的 JSON 都是公开的。"}],"structural_errors":[],"warnings":[]}
